		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Bullet 2.19a released]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=2241#p2241"><![CDATA[
New in Bullet 2.19a:<br><br>* better solver performance (caching the impulse arm/cross product)<br>* more generic concave support, uses the registered collision algorithm by using the dispatcher<br>* added back the safety catch in GJK for uninitialized transforms<br>* comparison algorithms: dedicated SphereTriangle, and in Extras/AlternativeCollisionAlgorithms the ODE box-box<br>* recompiled the C4 graphics engine integration (win32) for Bullet 2.19a<br><br>Download here:<br><a href="http://www.continuousphysics.com/mediawiki-1.5.8/index.php?title=Download" class="postlink">http://www.continuousphysics.com/mediaw ... e=Download</a><br><br>Have fun,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Sat Oct 28, 2006 2:45 am</p><hr />
